?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TZEIfDjYDuQQ7kNvwHrMKC7&_nc_oc=Adlq-4sSM5iFBoHKhBL-1NIEmNMqVd7x0wtct2dKSWhUIfBZ2SGNVok6WcA1_NxX078&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvF3OFcCYNXiKEg00D7XqkngN04ZQQMahv8CXi2DgOIfA&oe=69A2D630"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "IPTV Smart Cast", "keywords": ["IPTV", "Streaming", "Movies", "Series", "TV"], "long_description": "**IPTV Smart Cast** combines an elegant interface with advanced tools to ensure the best playback, free from buffering in your virtual theater.\n\n### Exclusive Features:\n\n* **\ud83d\udcfa Chromecast Support:** Watch Movies/Series on the big screen! Cast VOD content to your Chromecast with a single click.\n* **\ud83d\ude80 Maximum Performance:** Unleash full power with Hardware Acceleration decoding, ensuring smooth playback at high resolutions.\n* **\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Built-in DNS Switcher:** Is your ISP throttling? Change DNS settings in-app (Google, Cloudflare, AdGuard) to improve connectivity.\n* **\ud83c\udfac Premium VOD Experience:** Organize your library with official posters, detailed synopses, and cast info.\n* **\u23ef\ufe0f Resume Playback:** Started a movie and had to leave? The app remembers exactly where you left off.\n* **\ud83d\udd04Synchronized Playback:** The host controls play, pause, and seek, ensuring everyone stays on the same frame.\n* **\ud83c\udf99\ufe0fVoice Chat Integration:** Connect your Agora ID in settings to talk with your friends in real-time while you watch.\n\n### Essential Features:\n\n* **Xtream Codes Connection:** Fast login using only URL, Username, and Password.\n* **Electronic Program Guide (EPG):** View real-time scheduling for every channel.\n* **Favorites Manager:** Create your custom list of preferred channels.\n* **Modern Interface:** User-centric design optimized for a seamless experience.\n\n> **Disclaimer:**\n**IPTV Smart Cast IS A MEDIA PLAYER AND DOES NOT PROVIDE CONTENT. Users need access 